    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to an exhilarating arena shooter! Hone your skills and master the art of combos to maximize your score. Explore a theoretically infinite, procedurally generated arena that challenges you at every turn. Prepare to unleash your inner shooter and demonstrate your prowess in this relentless battle against the Lootboxes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies are hostile Lootboxes with different attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kills, Combo-kills and Melee strikes earn you temporary and permanent upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replayable, procedurally generated level with randomized layout and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You control the risk to reward ration for every battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple but recognisable art style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story mode with different paths and endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom Game mode lets you hunt for ever-higher high scores </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to an exhilarating arena shooter! Hone your skills and master the art of combos to maximize your score. Explore a theoretically infinite, procedurally generated arena that challenges you at every turn. Prepare to unleash your inner shooter and demonstrate your prowess in this relentless battle against the Lootboxes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies are hostile Lootboxes with different attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kills, Combo-kills and Melee strikes earn you temporary and permanent upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replayable, procedurally generated level with randomized layout and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You control the risk to reward ration for every battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple but recognisable art style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story mode with different paths and endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom Game mode lets you hunt for ever-higher high scores </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Step into a chaotic arena where you take on hordes of Lootboxes in a fast-paced roguelike shooter! Face off against endless waves of enemies, earn in-game currency for temporary upgrades, subscribe to all kinds of live services and collect DLC fragments to unlock permanent perks.",
